This repository contains a deployment recipe and Apache-2.0-licensed modifications
of vLLM source files. The modified vLLM files retain their upstream SPDX and
copyright notices.

Each distributed file under `runtime/overlay/vllm/` that differs from upstream
carries a prominent modification notice at the top of the file. The added
notice comments do not change executable behavior.

Patches 1-3 are backports of upstream vLLM work and are linked to their original
pull requests and commits in runtime/patch_manifest.json. Patches 4-7 are small
integration fixes developed while qualifying the Merlin checkpoint on the tested
4x RTX 4090 system.

